WEBVTT

00:25:58.996 --> 00:26:00.996
and the psychological trauma
going forward?

00:26:00.996 --> 00:26:06.316
YNH: Yeah, I mean,
these are the seeds of hatred

00:26:06.356 --> 00:26:08.636
and fear and misery

00:26:08.676 --> 00:26:13.836
that are being planted right now
in the minds and the bodies

00:26:13.836 --> 00:26:16.676
of tens of millions,
hundreds of millions of people, really.

00:26:16.676 --> 00:26:18.796
Because it's not just
the people in Ukraine,

00:26:18.836 --> 00:26:21.396
it's also in the countries around,
all over the world.

00:26:21.396 --> 00:26:26.036
And these seeds will give
a terrible harvest,

00:26:26.036 --> 00:26:30.196
terrible fruits in years,
in decades to come.